more to lose than to gain, and they're

00:11:23.800 --> 00:11:28.320
going to have to prove those balances

00:11:25.360 --> 00:11:30.839
are correct, or you lied on me. If I owe

00:11:28.320 --> 00:11:34.560
$500, and you're putting down that I owe

00:11:30.839 --> 00:11:36.400
